%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6626c84bb700413428bce8fec5aff79d, type: 3}
  m_Name: FiguringHerOut
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _description: 'the player decides she''s prying into jessi''s brain as much as
    she can. might as well find out how the clock ticks before buying it.


    she
    tells jessi that she can see jessi trying to feel better about herself, and it''s
    really not doing her any favors. why reject the facts when you can just face
    them?


    jessi lies and says that she''s not trying to spare her own feelings;
    it''s really not that bad!!! but the player immediately shuts her down by telling
    her to cut the crap. it''s so obvious that it''s laughable, so stop trying.


    jessi
    angrily gives up and admits that Fine, she is just trying to feel better about
    herself. the hell is wrong with that? player argues that EVERYTHING is wrong
    with that. there''s no merit to trying to run away from the truth; it just leads
    to more shortcomings.


    okay well is the player knows so much, why doesn''t
    she just tell her exactly whats wrong with her???!! why not just tell it to her
    face if she wants her to Face It so bad???!??!


    with pleasure.


    though,
    that''s quite a loaded question, isn''t it? what Terrible part of her does she
    wanna grapple in the time that she has now?'
  _sameOptionTarget: 0
  _lines:
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Might as well dissect her brain to figure out how it works.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Jessi, I can tell that you're trying to spare yourself from the
      facts, but I have to admit it's doing you far from any favors.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: It's plenty more beneficial to face reality than it is to run
      away from it.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: "Okay\u2014no\u2014I'm not trying to spare any \"feelings\" right
      now; things just aren't as bad as you say they are, alright?"
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Don't lie to me like that. It's so painfully obvious that it's
      laughable. Stop trying to hide behind that falsehood.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: ...arghh, fine. Fine fine fine fine fine. FINE!!!
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: I AM trying to feel better about myself. Okay? And what's wrong
      with that?
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Practically everything, in short.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: You and I both know that there's no merit to avoiding the truth;
      it just leads to more shortcomings.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Face it. It's better for you that way.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: You know what?? Since you know SOOOO much, why don't you just
      tell me exactly what's wrong with me, huh?!
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: You seem to have strong opinions about that, so why don't you
      just list it out for me?! Serve my ass on a silver platter for all I care!!!
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: With pleasure.
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Though, that's quite the loaded question, isn't it?
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: What terrible part of her is most worthwhile to discuss?
  _playerReplyOptions:
  - _choiceType: 2
    _optionText: Her innate incapabilities
  - _choiceType: 2
    _optionText: Her terrible personality
  _npcReplies:
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6fac4b126c457b4428c3628a362abe92, type: 2}
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: b3708a6e3b5696345bfa3902f91d2149, type: 2}
  _gameEnd: 0
